Bug Report Example

BUG001 – Search Field Returns No Results for Partial Match

Description: The search functionality does not return records when using partial text input, although matching records exist.

Type: Functional

Severity: Medium

STR 

Open listing page
Enter partial keyword in search field
Click Search

Actual Result: No results are displayed.

Expected Result: System should return records containing matching partial text.



